When writing unit tests, you should:
1. Use unittest.TestCase (and unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase for async) classes.
2. For all assertions, make sure that the expected value comes first
3. This is a unit test so normally we should patch all the complicated functions inside of the tested function.
4. Make sure we have good coverage of the original files.
